---
import Icon from "@components/Icon.astro";
import PagePlate from "@layouts/PagePlate.astro";

import instrument from "../assets/images/homepage/instruments.jpg";
import guitar from "../assets/images/homepage/guitar.jpg";
import headphone from "../assets/images/homepage/headphone.jpg";
import musifierLogo from "../assets/images/logo/Musifier_Logo.svg";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<PagePlate>
	{/*page 1*/}
	<main class={` sm:px-10 px-5 flex justify-center bg-blue-900 bg-blend-multiply bg-opacity-[0.9] bg-center bg-cover bg-local`} style={{backgroundImage: `url(${instrument.src})`}}>
		<article class='relative w-[70rem] pt-36 pb-36 min-h-screen'>
			{/*First Attachment*/}
			<section >
				<h6 class='my-text pb-4'>
					<span class='text-slate-400'>WELCOME TO</span>
					<span class='text-blue-300'> MUSIFIER</span>
				</h6>
				<h1 class="my-header">Learn the <span class='text-blue-300'>Music</span></h1>
				<h1 class="my-header">Apply the <span class='text-blue-300'>Theory</span></h1>
				<h1 class="my-header">Make your <span class='text-blue-300'>Sound</span></h1>
			</section>
			{/*2nd Attachment*/}
			<section class='pt-20'>
				<p class='my-text text-justify'>
				Eager to help you scale your skill to a greater level. A zealous to keep playing your instrument whenever you are. There is no best time to start your journey in music, so start today and experience the beat of life.
				</p>
			</section>
			{/*3rd Attachment*/}
			<section class='w-full absolute bottom-32  md:flex hidden justify-center'>
				<Icon name="naturalNote" inClass="fill-slate-300" outClass="size-20 animate-bounce"/>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>

	{/*page 2*/}
	<main class=' sm:px-10 px-5 flex justify-center bg-gray-800'>
		<article class='pt-32 pb-32 flex gap-x-10 sm:flex-nowrap flex-wrap' style={{width:"70rem"}}>

			<section class='flex-0 shrink mb-8'>
				<div class="relative sm:w-[13rem] w-[6rem] aspect-square" >
					<Image src={musifierLogo} alt="Creator's Logo" class="my-img" />
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class='flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center sm:mt-auto'>
				{/*First Attachment*/}
				<section class=''>
					<h1 class="my-header-flat text-slate-200 break-words">WHAT IS MUSIFIER?</h1>
				</section>
				{/*2nd Attachment*/}
				<section class='md:mt-10 sm:mt-5 sm:block hidden'>
					<p class='my-text text-justify'>
						Musifier is a web application that you can use to learn your favorite instruments. It also comes with other resources that you may need in learning music theory. One of its greatest feature is that you can learn and create musical scales that suits to your need. No need to be tech savvy, just click what sounds right to you.
					</p>
				</section>
			</section>
			{/*2nd Attachment*/}
			<section class=' mt-2 sm:hidden block'>
				<p class='my-text text-justify'>
					Musifier is a web application that you can use to learn your favorite instruments. It also comes with other resources that you may need in learning music theory. One of its greatest feature is that you can learn and create musical scales that suits to your need. No need to be tech savvy, just click what sounds right to you.
				</p>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>

	{/*page 3*/}
	<main class=' sm:px-10 px-5 flex justify-center bg-blue-900 bg-blend-multiply bg-opacity-[0.9] bg-center bg-cover bg-local' style={{backgroundImage:`url(${guitar.src})`}}>
		<article class='w-[70rem] py-32'>
			{/*First Attachment*/}
			<section >
				<h1 class={`my-header-flat text-slate-200 text-center`}>Guitar Fretboard</h1>
			</section>
			{/*2nd Attachment*/}
			<section class='pt-10'>
				<p class='my-text text-justify'>
					Having a hard time being acquainted with your fret-board? With Musifier, it can help you to familiarize your fret-board. It has a virtual fret-board that contains all notes of a standard 24 fret electric guitar. You can use the scale pattern to show what strings you should pick. You can try the built-in algorithm to guess what scale the song you are playing and roam around the fret-board to determine the best location to play the notes.
				</p>
			</section>
			{/*3rd Attachment*/}
			<section class='mt-10 sm:px-10'>
				<div class='aspect-video'>
					<div class='w-full h-full bg-blue-800'>

					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>

	{/*page 4*/}
	<main class=' sm:px-10 px-5 flex justify-center bg-blue-900 bg-blend-multiply bg-opacity-[0.9] bg-center bg-cover bg-local' style={{backgroundImage:`url(${headphone.src})`}}>
		<article class='w-[70rem] py-48'>
			{/*First Attachment*/}
			<section class=''>
				<h1 class={`my-title-big text-slate-200 text-center`}>and many more...</h1>
			</section>
			{/*2nd Attachment*/}
			<section class='pt-10'>
				<p class='my-text text-center'>
					The web application is still in BETA, so expect more to come.
				</p>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>
</PagePlate>